# Wave W17-I (Route 41): islet turf — wind-clipped turf on the Maelstrom islet tops, short salt-pale green combed flat by the spiral winds, white wind flecks lying one way (design: the Maelstrom Islands standing in the foam). Route 41’s only land ground; the lane’s water is byte-preserved entire.
